advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Rogues}

Summons Rogues to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Rogues summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Rogues.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Rogues}

Summons Rogues to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Rogues summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Rogues.
